scn 1
# Five Drakes (Crusades) in a line ordered onto an Aramon Barracks (arakeep): the step-out (VTOL_StepOut)
# spreads the stack on the hover ring.
name air-stack-barracks-5
ticks 1800
seed 7
players 2
crusades on
weapons on
map flat 160 160
type drake fbi zondrake
type keep fbi arakeep
group drakes 0 drake 5 cells 20,70 20,75 20,80 20,85 20,90
group keep 1 keep 1 cells 70,80
at 2 attack drakes @keep
pair stack drakes drakes cells=2
